exception\_only & \textbf{99.83}{\scriptsize$\pm$0.00} & 99.83 & 99.89{\scriptsize$\pm$0.10} & 96.58{\scriptsize$\pm$4.76}$^\dag$ \\
VOTA & 99.41 & 99.58 & 98.57 & 84.45 \\
no\_trace & 75.13 & 67.31 & 76.50 & 73.36 \\
